{"suttaId":"sn22.128","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[794,795],"vripara":"128"},"segments":{"sn22.128:0.3":"Tatiyasamudayadhammasuttaṃ","sn22.128:1.1":"Ekaṃ samayaṃ āyasmā ca sāriputto āyasmā ca mahākoṭṭhiko bārāṇasiyaṃ viharanti isipatane migadāye … pe …","sn22.128:1.2":"ekamantaṃ nisinno kho āyasmā mahākoṭṭhiko āyasmantaṃ sāriputtaṃ etadavoca –","sn22.128:1.3":"“‘vijjā, vijjā’ti, āvuso sāriputta, vuccati.","sn22.128:1.4":"Katamā nu kho, āvuso, vijjā,","sn22.128:1.5":"kittāvatā ca vijjāgato hotī”ti?","sn22.128:2.1":"“Idhāvuso, sutavā ariyasāvako samudayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ ‘samudayadhammaṃ rūpan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti; vayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ … pe … samudayavayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ ‘samudayavayadhammaṃ rūpan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.128:2.2":"samudayadhammaṃ vedanaṃ … pe … samudayavayadhammā vedanā …","sn22.128:2.3":"samudayadhammaṃ saññaṃ … pe …","sn22.128:2.4":"samudayadhamme saṅkhāre … vayadhamme saṅkhāre … samudayavayadhamme saṅkhāre ‘samudayavayadhammā saṅkhārā’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti.","sn22.128:2.5":"Samudayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ … vayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ … samudayavayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ ‘samudayavayadhammaṃ viññāṇan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti.","sn22.128:2.6":"Ayaṃ vuccatāvuso, vijjā;","sn22.128:2.7":"ettāvatā ca vijjāgato hotī”ti.","sn22.128:2.8":"Tatiyaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":387,"to":390,"paras":[{"para":387,"vripara":"126-135","refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["126-135. Avijjāvaggo uttānatthova.","Imasmiñhi vagge sabbasuttesu catusaccameva kathitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"],["sn22.128:1"]]},{"para":388,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["Avijjāvaggo terasamo."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"]]},{"para":389,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"]]},{"para":390,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["1-13. Kukkuḷasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":390,"to":394,"paras":[{"para":390,"vripara":"126-135","refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["126-135. <b>Imasmin</b>ti avijjāvagge.","<b>Catusaccameva kathitaṃ, tasmā</b> heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānamevāti adhippāyo."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"],["sn22.128:1"]]},{"para":391,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["Samudayadhammasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"]]},{"para":392,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["Avijjāvaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"]]},{"para":393,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"]]},{"para":394,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.128:1"],"lines":["1-14. Kukkuḷasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.128:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
